'''McGrubber's Burger''' is an {{Epic}} [[Permanent Consumable]] item in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Obtaining ==
'''McGrubber's Burger''' is a {{O|e|no=yes}} drop from {{Stier|4}} {{MobSprite|Riftstalker Bloodfiend}} or above once the player reaches {{coll|Vampire Slayer 5}}.

=== Drop Chances ===
* {{Stier|4}}: {{Chance|1.22%|1|81.97|kills}}
* {{Stier|5}}: {{Chance|1.2%|1|83.33|kills}}

== Usage ==
The player can consume up to 5 '''McGrubber's Burgers''', which each give a {{Light Purple|Grubber Stack}}, granting:
* {{Stat|rt|+12}}
* {{Light Purple|+5%}} {{Motes}} from the {{NPCSprite|Motes Grubber}}
* {{Light Purple|+40}} {{Motes}} on [[Motes#Obtaining|{{Purple|Orb}}]] pickup
* [[SkyBlock Levels|{{Aqua|+5 SkyBlock XP}}]]
In total, {{Green|5}} {{Light Purple|Grubber Stack}} will grant:

* {{Stat|rt|+60}}
* {{Light Purple|+25%}} {{Motes}} from the {{NPCSprite|Motes Grubber}}
* {{Light Purple|+200}} {{Motes}} on [[Motes#Obtaining|{{Purple|Orb}}]] pickup
* [[SkyBlock Levels|{{Aqua|+25 SkyBlock XP}}]]

